</style></div><div><div class="w-embed"><style>
/* Overlay ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
.geo-gate {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  z-index: 2147483647;
  display: none;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 24px;
  background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
  backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
  overflow-y: auto;
  overscroll-behavior: contain;
}

.geo-gate.is-open {
  display: flex;
}

/* Card ------------------------------------------------------------------- */
.geo-gate .geo-gate_card {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 560px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 40px;
  background-color: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 16px;
  box-shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24);
  font-family: inherit;
  text-align: left;
}

/* Title ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
.geo-gate .geo-gate_title {
  margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  font-size: 22px;
  line-height: 1.3;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #0f172a;
}

/* Body copy -------------------------------------------------------------- */
.geo-gate .geo-gate_body {
  margin: 0;
}

.geo-gate .geo-gate_text:last-child,
.geo-gate .geo-gate_body p:last-child {
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

/* Actions ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
.geo-gate .geo-gate_actions {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-top: 28px;
}

/* Buttons ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
.geo-gate .geo-gate_btn {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  flex: 1 1 180px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  min-height: 48px;
  padding: 14px 20px;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 10px;
  font-family: inherit;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.3;
  text-align: center;
  text-decoration: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background-color 0.18s ease, opacity 0.18s ease;
  -webkit-appearance: none;
  appearance: none;
}

.geo-gate .geo-gate_btn-accept {
  background-color: #0f172a;
  color: #ffffff;
}

.geo-gate .geo-gate_btn-accept:hover {
  background-color: #1e293b;
  color: #ffffff;
}

.geo-gate .geo-gate_btn-decline {
  background-color: #f1f5f9;
  color: #0f172a;
}

.geo-gate .geo-gate_btn-decline:hover {
  background-color: #e2e8f0;
  color: #0f172a;
}

.geo-gate .geo-gate_btn:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid #2563eb;
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

/* Scroll lock ------------------------------------------------------------ */
body.geo-gate-locked {
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* Mobile ----------------------------------------------------------------- */
@media screen and (max-width: 479px) {
  .geo-gate {
    padding: 16px;
  }
  .geo-gate .geo-gate_card {
    padding: 28px 24px;
    border-radius: 14px;
  }
  .geo-gate .geo-gate_title {
    font-size: 19px;
  }
  .geo-gate .geo-gate_actions {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .geo-gate .geo-gate_btn {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    width: 100%;
  }
}

/* Reduced motion --------------------------------------------------------- */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .geo-gate .geo-gate_btn {
    transition: none;
  }
}
</style></div><div id="geoGate" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="geoGateTitle" aria-hidden="true" class="geo-gate"><div class="geo-gate_card"><h2 id="geoGateTitle" data-wf--heading--settings-size="title-m" class="g-header w-variant-d38ba5e1-ecae-8bb0-672d-efffa7a31e18 geo-gate_title">繼續前往 StraitsX 中文網站？</h2><div class="geo-gate_body"><div data-text-align="" data-wf--rich-text-plain--text-size="base" class="u-rt-plain w-richtext geo-gate_text"><p>您即將前往 StraitsX 中文網站。</p><p>‍</p><p>網站內容僅供一般資訊及企業業務介紹之用。StraitsX 的產品及服務受不同司法管轄區的適用法律及監管要求約束，部分產品及服務可能不適用於您所在的地區。</p><p>‍</p><p>StraitsX 相關實體的監管及牌照資訊以網站披露為準。</p></div></div><div class="geo-gate_actions"><a data-geo-gate="decline" href="#" class="geo-gate_btn geo-gate_btn-decline w-button">返回</a><a data-geo-gate="accept" href="#" class="geo-gate_btn geo-gate_btn-accept w-button">繼續瀏覽</a></div></div></div></div><style>:root {--spacing--lg-1_25: clamp(1rem, 0.9119718309859155rem + 0.3755868544600939vw, 1.25rem);--spacing--xl-1_5: clamp(1.2rem, 1.0943661971830987rem + 0.4507042253521127vw, 1.5rem);--spacing--2xl-2: clamp(1.6rem, 1.4591549295774648rem + 0.60093896713615vw, 2rem);--spacing--3xl-2_5: clamp(2rem, 1.823943661971831rem + 0.7511737089201878vw, 2.5rem);--spacing--4xl-3: clamp(2.4rem, 2.1887323943661974rem + 0.9014084507042254vw, 3rem);--spacing--5xl-3_5: clamp(2.8rem, 2.553521126760563rem + 1.0516431924882632vw, 3.5rem);--spacing--6xl-4: clamp(3.2rem, 2.9183098591549297rem + 1.2018779342723vw, 4rem);--spacing--7xl-5: clamp(4rem, 3.647887323943662rem + 1.5023474178403755vw, 5rem);--spacing--8xl-6: clamp(4.8rem, 4.377464788732395rem + 1.8028169014084507vw, 6rem);--spacing--9xl-7: clamp(5.6rem, 5.107042253521126rem + 2.1032863849765264vw, 7rem);--spacing--10xl-8: clamp(6.4rem, 5.836619718309859rem + 2.4037558685446vw, 8rem);--spacing--12xl-12: clamp(9.6rem, 8.75492957746479rem + 3.6056338028169015vw, 12rem);--spacing--11xl-10: clamp(8rem, 7.295774647887324rem + 3.004694835680751vw, 10rem);--spacing--13xl-15: 