">Copied!</div></div></section><section id="actions" class="g-section-single u-padding-global"><div data-wf--background-color--variant="base" class="g-background"></div><div data-wf--structure-spacing--variant="small" class="g_section_space w-variant-f080ba40-7e14-bed9-444d-50971aff40c9"></div><div data-motion="reveal" class="u-container-lg stackable_layout u-gap-4xl"><div><div data-wf--headline-hero-s--align-items="center" class="headliner_wrap"><div class="headliner_contain u-gap-base"><h2 data-wf--heading--settings-size="display-m" class="g-header">XSGD in action</h2></div></div></div><div><div data-motion="reveal" data-wf--structure-container-3-column--variant="6xl" class="g-3-col_wrapper"><div class="g-3-col_wrapper u-grid-autofill w-variant-f73ac771-dc0b-c752-1f0b-499d9902402a"><div data-wf--card-info--variant="base" class="info-card"><div data-wf--icon--variant="medium-48px" class="g-icon w-variant-7a298f74-6404-312a-67cd-02e686572028"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6119d1f2b05f8e85e873971a/6833f9c329fc468031b1f516_xsgd-Icon%2017.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="g-icon w-variant-7a298f74-6404-312a-67cd-02e686572028"/></div><div><div data-wf--headline-card--align-items="left" class="headliner_wrap w-variant-03897337-3fde-1d87-59f6-59727b60e495"><div class="headliner_contain w-variant-03897337-3fde-1d87-59f6-59727b60e495 u-gap-sm"><h3 data-wf--heading--settings-size="title-m" class="g-header w-variant-d38ba5e1-ecae-8bb0-672d-efffa7a31e18">SGD on Chain</h3><div class="u-text-color-secondary w-variant-03897337-3fde-1d87-59f6-59727b60e495">Access the Singapore Dollar on supported blockchains for faster settlements, FX flexibility, and digital payments. Move SGD 24/7 without traditional banking delays.</div></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--card-info--variant="base" class="info-card"><div data-wf--icon--variant="medium-48px" class="g-icon w-variant-7a298f74-6404-312a-67cd-02e686572028"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6119d1f2b05f8e85e873971a/6833f9c280e06239951e2827_xsgd-Icon%2018.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="g-icon w-variant-7a298f74-6404-312a-67cd-02e686572028"/></div><div><div data-wf--headline-card--align-items="left" class="headliner_wrap w-variant-03897337-3fde-1d87-59f6-59727b60e495"><div class="headliner_contain w-variant-03897337-3fde-1d87-59f6-59727b60e495 u-gap-sm"><h3 data-wf--heading--settings-size="title-m" class="g-header w-variant-d38ba5e1-ecae-8bb0-672d-efffa7a31e18">Regional Utility</h3><div class="u-text-color-secondary w-variant-03897337-3fde-1d87-59f6-59727b60e495">XSGD is accepted across wallets, exchanges, and fintech platforms in Asia. Power cross-border flows, retail payments, and ecosystem integrations across the region.</div></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--card-info--variant="base" class="info-card"><div data-wf--icon--variant="medium-48px" class="g-icon w-variant-7a298f74-6404-312a-67cd-02e686572028"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6119d1f2b05f8e85e873971a/6833f9c357714123c289047a_xsgd-Icon%2019.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="g-icon w-variant-7a298f74-6404-312a-67cd-02e686572028"/></div><div><div data-wf--headline-card--align-items="left" class="headliner_wrap w-variant-03897337-3fde-1d87-59f6-59727b60e495"><div class="headliner_contain w-variant-03897337-3fde-1d87-59f6-59727b60e495 u-gap-sm"><h3 data-wf--heading--settings-size="title-m" class="g-header w-variant-d38ba5e1-ecae-8bb0-672d-efffa7a31e18">FX-Ready Rail</h3><div class="u-text-color-secondary w-variant-03897337-3fde-1d87-59f6-59727b60e495">Use XSGD as an efficient on-chain SGD rail for local payments and cross-border FX. Ideal for businesses expanding across Southeast Asia.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--structure-spacing--variant="small" class="g_section_space w-variant-f080ba40-7e14-bed9-444d-50971aff40c9"></div></section><div data-wf--structure-spacing--variant="main" class="g_section_space"></div><section id="report" class="section_stablecoin-report u-padding-global"><div data-motion="reveal" class="u-container-lg"><div class="stablecoin-report_layout"><div id="w-node-_4dca60a9-9752-b382-944b-b5d2fe11fc66-4394f981" class="stablecoin-layout_main"><div data-wf--headline-hero-s--align-items="left" class="headliner_wrap w-variant-42a06e54-1472-45b4-bff3-009c64b1a016"><div class="headliner_contain w-variant-42a06e54-1472-45b4-bff3-009c64b1a016 u-gap-base"><h2 data-wf--heading--settings-size="display-m" class="g-header">Transparency at our core: Reserve attestation reports</h2><div data-a-desc="" class="u-text-style-lg w-variant-42a06e54-1472-45b4-bff3-009c64b1a016">XSGD is fully backed by reserve assets and is always redeemable on a 1:1 basis with the Singapore Dollar. To reflect our commitment to transparency and compliance, we publish reserve attestation reports from an ISCA-listed auditing firm on a monthly basis.</div></div></div><div data-accordion-close-siblings="true" data-accordion-css-init="" class="accordion-css"><ul class="accordion-css__list"><div><li data-accordion-status="active" id="2026-reports" class="accordion-css__item"><div data-hover="" data-accordion-toggle="" class="accordion-css__item-top"><h3 data-wf--heading--settings-size="title-m" class="g-header w-variant-d38ba5e1-ecae-8bb0-672d-efffa7a31e18">2026</h3><div class="accordion-css__item-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 36 36" fill="none" class="accordion-css__item-icon-svg"><path d="M7.5 18H28.5M18 7.5V28.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-miterlimit="10"></path></svg></div></div><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-wrap"><div class="accordion-css__item-bottom-content"><div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="accordion-content_report u-grid-autofill-2 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="gated-modal_btn"><div class="gated-modal_btn-overlay w-embed"><button class="gated-modal_btn-overlay" type="button